@startuml
title Command / Action / Transaction

skinparam legendBackgroundColor #f9f9f9
skinparam legendBorderColor #999999

legend right

**Intent**:
Encapsulate requests as objects; support queueing, logging, undo.

**Motivation**:
UI menu actions, task scheduling, macro recording.

**Applicability**:
Parameterize invokers with operations; decouple sender from receiver.

**Participants**:
Invoker triggers; Command encapsulates; Receiver performs.

**Consequences**:
Pros: Queueing; undo/redo; macro; logs.
Cons: Many small classes; need undo logic carefully.

**Implementation Notes**:
Store state for undo; composite commands for macro.

**Known Uses**:
Swing Actions; job schedulers; CQRS commands.

**Related Patterns**:
Memento (undo state), Composite (macro commands), Chain of Responsibility.

endlegend

interface Command {
  +execute()
}

class ConcreteCommand
class Receiver {
  +action()
}

class Invoker {
  -cmd : Command
  +setCommand(c: Command)
  +invoke()
}

Command <|.. ConcreteCommand
ConcreteCommand o-- Receiver
Invoker o-- Command
@enduml